      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.16,
          "end": 4.86,
          "en": "So now with the Google Maps package set up,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.86,
          "end": 6.66,
          "en": "I'll add a new screen actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.66,
          "end": 10.53,
          "en": "because I wanna open this map as a full screen map.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.53,
          "end": 13.83,
          "en": "And hence here in the screens folder, in the lib folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.83,
          "end": 15.963,
          "en": "I'll add a map.dart file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.07,
          "end": 20.16,
          "en": "And in there, I'll add a new MapScreen class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.16,
          "end": 23.688,
          "en": "which extends StatefulWidget actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.688,
          "end": 28.02,
          "en": "because I want to be able to pick a place there as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.02,
          "end": 30.6,
          "en": "And at the same time, I also want to be able",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.6,
          "end": 33.72,
          "en": "to show an already picked location.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.72,
          "end": 36.01,
          "en": "And therefore here, I'll expect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.848,
          "end": 41.34,
          "en": "to get a PlaceLocation value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.34,
          "end": 43.744,
          "en": "So I will create a property location,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.744,
          "end": 46.031,
          "en": "which is of type PlaceLocation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.031,
          "end": 48.45,
          "en": "and of course you must add that import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.45,
          "end": 51.633,
          "en": "to the place.dart file in the models folder therefore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.791,
          "end": 56.13,
          "en": "And this should be set through the constructor.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.13,
          "end": 58.05,
          "en": "So here for the MapScreen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.05,
          "end": 61.11,
          "en": "I, of course, get and forward that key as always.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.11,
          "end": 64.631,
          "en": "But in addition, I also want to get such a location.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.631,
          "end": 68.94,
          "en": "However, here I actually won't require this location",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.94,
          "end": 71.501,
          "en": "because whilst I of course will need a location",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.501,
          "end": 74.28,
          "en": "to show an existing location,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.28,
          "end": 77.76,
          "en": "if we open this MapScreen from the place detail screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.76,
          "end": 81.24,
          "en": "I don't need a location if we're picking a location",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.24,
          "end": 84.33,
          "en": "for the first time from the add place screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.33,
          "end": 87.273,
          "en": "so if we clicked on this select on map button here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.44,
          "end": 91.89,
          "en": "So therefore, I'll actually add the location parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.89,
          "end": 95.16,
          "en": "but I'll not add the required keyword,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 95.16,
          "end": 98.44800000000001,
          "en": "but instead set this equal to an initial location",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.44800000000001,
          "end": 101.894,
          "en": "by adding an equal sign here to assign a default value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.894,
          "end": 103.63499999999999,
          "en": "to this parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.63499999999999,
          "end": 107.642,
          "en": "which will be used if no other value is passed in instead,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 107.642,
          "end": 110.193,
          "en": "which would take precedence though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.78,
          "end": 115.831,
          "en": "And here, I'll then create a new place location object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 115.831,
          "end": 120.831,
          "en": "where I'll set the default location to 37.422",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 121.74,
          "end": 125.86,
          "en": "and then the longitude to minus 122.084",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 127.918,
          "end": 130.44,
          "en": "which should be the default location",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 130.44,
          "end": 132.99,
          "en": "of the Google offices.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 132.99,
          "end": 135.42,
          "en": "And for the address, I'll add an empty string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 135.42,
          "end": 136.82999999999998,
          "en": "because I don't really care about",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 136.82999999999998,
          "end": 138.963,
          "en": "that human readable address here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 141.45,
          "end": 144.66,
          "en": "So that's now this default location which is set here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 144.66,
          "end": 147.81,
          "en": "and which will be used if no more specific location",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 147.81,
          "end": 150.48,
          "en": "is passed in for this parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 150.48,
          "end": 151.74,
          "en": "And this simply allows us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 151.74,
          "end": 154.23,
          "en": "to use the MapScreen in different scenarios.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 154.23,
          "end": 156.049,
          "en": "One scenario where we have a location",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 156.049,
          "end": 159.84,
          "en": "and one scenario where we don't have it yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 159.84,
          "end": 161.91,
          "en": "Now of course, besides adding all these things,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 161.91,
          "end": 165.39,
          "en": "we also need that good old create state method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 165.39,
          "end": 169.07999999999998,
          "en": "where we create the state for this map screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 169.07999999999998,
          "end": 171.06,
          "en": "And then also that second class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 171.06,
          "end": 175.59,
          "en": "the _MapScreenState class, which extends state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 175.59,
          "end": 177.57,
          "en": "that belongs to this widget here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 177.57,
          "end": 180.06,
          "en": "And we return a new instance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 180.06,
          "end": 184.683,
          "en": "of this MapScreenState class down here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 185.73,
          "end": 188.97,
          "en": "Now we can add that build method as always.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 188.97,
          "end": 191.073,
          "en": "And here I now want to build that map.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 192.03,
          "end": 194.55,
          "en": "Now technically, it'll still be a screen though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 194.55,
          "end": 197.13,
          "en": "and therefore I'll use the good old scaffold widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 197.13,
          "end": 200.88,
