          "end": 404.37,
          "en": "And there we have a latitude",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 404.37,
          "end": 408.843,
          "en": "and we also have a widget location longitude here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 409.95,
          "end": 411.72,
          "en": "So that's all available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 411.72,
          "end": 415.593,
          "en": "And therefore we can create this lat long object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 417.57,
          "end": 419.73,
          "en": "We also should set assume level.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 419.73,
          "end": 421.56,
          "en": "And here I'll set this to 16,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 421.56,
          "end": 423.15,
          "en": "though of course you can play",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 423.15,
          "end": 425.19,
          "en": "around with different values here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 425.19,
          "end": 428.193,
          "en": "to, well, show more or less of the map.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 429.09,
          "end": 430.14,
          "en": "Now with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 430.14,
          "end": 433.05,
          "en": "besides setting this initial camera position,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 433.05,
          "end": 437.58,
          "en": "we can also add a markers list to the Google Map here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 437.58,
          "end": 439.35,
          "en": "And of course, as always,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 439.35,
          "end": 441.27,
          "en": "you can press controlled space here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 441.27,
          "end": 443.58,
          "en": "inside of that Google Map parameter list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 443.58,
          "end": 446.31,
          "en": "to learn what can be set there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 446.31,
          "end": 449.58,
          "en": "You see there are a bunch of parameters that can be set,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 449.58,
          "end": 451.04200000000003,
          "en": "but here it's markers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 451.04200000000003,
          "end": 456.04200000000003,
          "en": "and markers allows you to create a so-called set of markers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 456.24,
          "end": 458.01,
          "en": "Now a set is a new data type,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 458.01,
          "end": 460.05,
          "en": "which we haven't used before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 460.05,
          "end": 463.95,
          "en": "You create it with curly braces like a map,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 463.95,
          "end": 468.33,
          "en": "but unlike a map, it's not a selection of key value pairs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 468.33,
          "end": 471.454,
          "en": "but instead just a list of values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 471.454,
          "end": 473.1,
          "en": "So it's like a list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 473.1,
          "end": 477.06,
          "en": "but created with curly braces instead of square brackets.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 477.06,
          "end": 478.77,
          "en": "And the special thing about a set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 478.77,
          "end": 482.19,
          "en": "is that it doesn't allow duplicate values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 482.19,
          "end": 486.75,
          "en": "If you would try to add an already existing value to a set,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 486.75,
          "end": 489.78,
          "en": "it would not be added, it would not work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 489.78,
          "end": 491.1,
          "en": "In a list, that's different.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 491.1,
          "end": 492.78,
          "en": "If you have a list of strings,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 492.78,
          "end": 495.54,
          "en": "you can have exactly the same text in that list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 495.54,
          "end": 497.1,
          "en": "as often as you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 497.1,
          "end": 499.08,
          "en": "In a set, that does not work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 499.08,
          "end": 503.553,
          "en": "And markers simply wants such a set of marker objects here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 505.14,
          "end": 506.55,
          "en": "So a set it is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 506.55,
          "end": 508.809,
          "en": "and in there we can create a new marker,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 508.809,
          "end": 511.59,
          "en": "which should mark the selected location.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 511.59,
          "end": 514.5,
          "en": "For that I'm creating this new marker object here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 514.5,
          "end": 515.91,
          "en": "with the marker class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 515.91,
          "end": 518.64,
          "en": "that's provided by the Google Maps package.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 518.64,
          "end": 521.97,
          "en": "And here we then should provide a markerId,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 521.97,
          "end": 525.36,
          "en": "which is actually a markerId object created",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 525.36,
          "end": 528.81,
          "en": "with markerId with that class here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 528.81,
          "end": 531.39,
          "en": "And here you should simply provide a unique id.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 531.39,
          "end": 534.84,
          "en": "And since these markers are not dynamically generated here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 534.84,
          "end": 537,
          "en": "but instead only have one marker here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 537,
          "end": 538.41,
          "en": "which I'm creating in code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 538.41,
          "end": 540.363,
          "en": "I'll give it a hard coded idea of m1.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 542.04,
          "end": 544.95,
          "en": "And this can now be a constant value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 544.95,
          "end": 547.114,
          "en": "And a marker also needs a position",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 547.114,
          "end": 550.08,
          "en": "which defines where the marker will be placed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 550.08,
          "end": 553.41,
          "en": "And here I'll set this equal to a lat long object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 553.41,
          "end": 555.573,
          "en": "because that is what position wants,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 556.47,
          "end": 558.66,
          "en": "and that's the same object as up here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 558.66,
          "end": 560.52,
          "en": "with widget locational latitude",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 560.52,
          "end": 563.553,
          "en": "and widget location longitude like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 565.86,
          "end": 567.96,
          "en": "With that, we're showing such a marker",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 567.96,
          "end": 570.87,
          "en": "and we don't have the logic for picking a place yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 570.87,
          "end": 573.18,
          "en": "but we have the logic for showing a place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 573.18,
          "end": 575.043,
          "en": "and hence that's what we can do now.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
